{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: 工程实践MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Agent 的容错设计和错误处理机制如何设计？\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"工程实践\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/工程实践\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">工程实践MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"Agent 的容错设计和错误处理机制如何设计？\" dir=\"auto\">Agent 的容错设计和错误处理机制如何设计？</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Agent 在执行复杂任务时会遇到各种错误，如何设计健壮的容错和错误恢复机制？</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>一、分层错误分类与处理</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ErrorClassifier</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"错误分类器\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    ERROR_TYPES <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># === 可恢复错误 (Retryable) ===</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"TRANSIENT\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"examples\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"网络超时\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"API限流\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"临时服务不可用\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"strategy\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"指数退避重试（最多3次）\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"retry\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">True</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># === 可降级错误 (Degradable) ===</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"DEGRADABLE\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"examples\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"主模型不可用\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"工具服务故障\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"strategy\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"切换到备用模型/工具\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"fallback\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">True</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># === 用户可修正错误 (UserFixable) ===</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"USER_FIXABLE\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"examples\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"参数不完整\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"权限不足\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"输入格式错误\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"strategy\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"向用户请求澄清\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"clarify\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">True</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># === 不可恢复错误 (Fatal) ===</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"FATAL\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"examples\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"数据损坏\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"配置错误\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"系统性故障\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"strategy\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"记录日志，转人工处理\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"escalate\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">True</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>二、Agent 级别自愈设计</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">SelfHealingAgent</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"具备自愈能力的 Agent\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">execute_with_recovery</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Task<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> Result<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        state <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> TaskState<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> step <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">range</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>MAX_STEPS<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">try</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                action <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_plan_next_action<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                observation <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_execute_action<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>action<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                state<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_observation<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>observation<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                \n                <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> state<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>is_complete<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> state<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get_result<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                    \n            <span class=\"token keyword\">except</span> ToolExecutionError <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> e<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token comment\"># 工具调用失败时的自愈逻辑</span>\n                recovery <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_decide_recovery<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> e<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                \n                <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> recovery <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"retry\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                    <span class=\"token keyword\">continue</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 重试当前步骤</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">elif</span> recovery <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"alternative_tool\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                    state<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>use_alternative_tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 使用替代工具</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">elif</span> recovery <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"skip\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                    state<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>mark_skipped<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 跳过此步骤</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">elif</span> recovery <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"ask_user\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_ask_user_for_help<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> e<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">else</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> Result<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>error<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"无法恢复: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>e<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> Result<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>error<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"超过最大步数限制\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_decide_recovery</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> state<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> TaskState<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> error<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Exception<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"让 LLM 决定恢复策略\"\"\"</span>\n        prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"\"\"\n        当前任务状态：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>summary<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n        遇到错误：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>error<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n        可用恢复选项：retry, alternative_tool, skip, ask_user\n        请选择最佳恢复策略并说明原因：\n        \"\"\"</span></span>\n        decision <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>invoke<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> decision<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>strip<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>三、断点续传机制</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">CheckpointManager</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"断点续传管理器\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> redis_client<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Redis<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>redis <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> redis_client\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>checkpoint_interval <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">3</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 每 3 步保存一次</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">save_checkpoint</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> session_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> state<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> AgentState<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"保存检查点\"\"\"</span>\n        checkpoint <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"timestamp\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> time<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>time<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"current_step\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> state<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>current_step<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"memory\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> state<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>serialize<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"intermediate_results\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> state<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>intermediate_results<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"tool_call_history\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> state<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tool_calls\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>redis<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>setex<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n            <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"checkpoint:</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>session_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            ttl<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">86400</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 24h 过期</span>\n            value<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>json<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>dumps<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>checkpoint<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">restore_checkpoint</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> session_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> AgentState <span class=\"token operator\">|</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"从检查点恢复\"\"\"</span>\n        data <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>redis<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"checkpoint:</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>session_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> data<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            checkpoint <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> json<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>loads<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>data<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> AgentState<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>deserialize<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>checkpoint<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>\"工具调用无限循环怎么防止？\"</strong> — 设置最大循环步数（如 10 步），每步记录 Trace</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>\"Agent 执行到一半崩溃了怎么办？\"</strong> — 断点续传：中间状态持久化到 Redis，崩溃后从最近检查点恢复</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">工程实践MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}